WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:09.200
If you entrust me with the presidency you do not pay any tax at all because we don't need a tax code.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.639
Let me take this moment to say something we don't say nearly enough

00:00:12.639 --> 00:00:15.839
the days of cozying up to the law is
over.

00:00:15.839 --> 00:00:19.359
I will not let that happen you have my
word.

00:00:19.359 --> 00:00:23.199
Give people school choice with results
available immediately.

00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:27.040
I hear their voices if you listen you
can hear them too, no nearly a century

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.240
ago Franklin Roosevelt pledged a new deal

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.280
too much power
and my fellow americans that is

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.160
unforgivable
those are words for our time under

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.640
president biden american soldiers
military stay in their homes with

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.920
dignity
i accept this nomination thank you and

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.719
may god bless you
and may god protect our life liberty and

00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:54.719
